{"path":"error/system_error/operator=","title":"std::system_error::operator=","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::system_error::</span>operator=","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/error/system_error/operator=","section":"error","kind":"page","summary":"Assigns the contents with those of other. If *this and other both have dynamic type std::system_error then std::strcmp(what(), other.what()) == 0 after assignment.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">system_error<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> operator<span class=\"sy1\">=</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> system_error<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> other <span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Assigns the contents with those of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">other</span></code>. If <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code> and <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">other</span></code> both have dynamic type <code>std::system_error</code> then <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/byte/strcmp\"><span class=\"kw1154\">std::<span class=\"me2\">strcmp</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>what<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>, other.<span class=\"me1\">what</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> <span class=\"nu0\">0</span></span></code> after assignment.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> other\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> another <code>system_error</code> object to assign with\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code>\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;cassert&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;cstring&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;system_error&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">void</span> print<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/error/system_error\"><span class=\"kw963\">std::<span class=\"me2\">system_error</span></span></a><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> e<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"code:    [\"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> e.<span class=\"me1\">code</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"]<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span>\n                 <span class=\"st0\">\"message: [\"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> e.<span class=\"me1\">code</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>.<span class=\"me1\">message</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"]<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span>\n                 <span class=\"st0\">\"what:    [\"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> e.<span class=\"me1\">what</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"]<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span><span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/error/system_error\"><span class=\"kw963\">std::<span class=\"me2\">system_error</span></span></a> e1<span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/error/errno_macros\"><span class=\"kw814\">EDOM</span></a>, <a href=\"/w/cpp/error/generic_category\"><span class=\"kw876\">std::<span class=\"me2\">generic_category</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>, <span class=\"st0\">\"Error info #1\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    print<span class=\"br0\">(</span>e1<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/error/system_error\"><span class=\"kw963\">std::<span class=\"me2\">system_error</span></span></a> e2<span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/error/errno_macros\"><span class=\"kw824\">EIO</span></a>, <a href=\"/w/cpp/error/system_category\"><span class=\"kw877\">std::<span class=\"me2\">system_category</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>, <span class=\"st0\">\"Error info #2\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    print<span class=\"br0\">(</span>e2<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    e1 <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> e2<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/error/assert\"><span class=\"kw778\">assert</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/byte/strcmp\"><span class=\"kw1154\">std::<span class=\"me2\">strcmp</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>e1.<span class=\"me1\">what</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>, e2.<span class=\"me1\">what</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> <span class=\"nu0\">0</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    print<span class=\"br0\">(</span>e1<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Possible output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>code:    [generic:33]\nmessage: [Numerical argument out of domain]\nwhat:    [Error info #1: Numerical argument out of domain]\n&nbsp;\ncode:    [system:5]\nmessage: [Input/output error]\nwhat:    [Error info #2: Input/output error]\n&nbsp;\ncode:    [system:5]\nmessage: [Input/output error]\nwhat:    [Error info #2: Input/output error]</code></pre> \n</div>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"error","title":"Diagnostics library"},{"path":"error/system_error","title":"std::system_error"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::system_error::operator=","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++11. Assigns the contents with those of other."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"other"},{"label":"Return value","note":"*this"},{"label":"Example"}]},"standards":["C++11"],"wordCount":146,"codeBlockCount":2}
